WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.573
Assalamu alaikum!

00:00:02.573 --> 00:00:11.025
This short guide shows ISSV teachers how to run a virtual Sunday class with Google Classroom and Google Meet.

00:00:11.025 --> 00:00:14.625
First, make sure you’re signed in with your LearnIslam account,

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:16.275
not a personal Gmail.

00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:20.086
The admin has already created your classes and added your students,

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:23.660
so they’re waiting on your Classroom home page.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.468
Each grade has a first period class and a second period class,

00:00:27.468 --> 00:00:29.920
and each one needs its own Meet link.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.735
You only do this once.

00:00:31.735 --> 00:00:35.513
In each class, click the gear icon to open “Settings”.

00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:37.549
Settings opens as a new page.

00:00:37.549 --> 00:00:41.326
Scroll down to “Manage Meet link”, next to the Google Meet logo,

00:00:41.326 --> 00:00:42.563
and click it.

00:00:42.563 --> 00:00:45.487
Click “Generate link”, turn on “Visible to students”,

00:00:45.487 --> 00:00:46.425
and click “Save”.

00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:51.905
Now each class has one Meet link for every virtual Sunday.

00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:54.725
Please don’t post links anywhere else.

00:00:54.725 --> 00:00:57.991
On Saturday, post a quick reminder in the Stream.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.582
Something like: Virtual class tomorrow!

00:01:00.582 --> 00:01:03.471
Test your connection from 10:00 to 10:15.

00:01:03.471 --> 00:01:06.693
Join from the Meet link here, with your LearnIslam account.

00:01:07.891 --> 00:01:12.907
On Sunday, open the Meet at about 9:50, straight from your class page.

00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:17.055
Click the “Host controls” shield, and turn on “Host management”.

00:01:17.055 --> 00:01:19.930
Now you can mute everyone, decide who joins,

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.667
and remove anyone disrupting class.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:27.576
Students signed in with a personal account will show up as “asking to join”.

00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:30.848
Check the name against your class roster before admitting,

00:01:30.848 --> 00:01:33.893
and fix any display names you don’t recognize.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:36.415
Before class ends, open the “People” panel,

00:01:36.415 --> 00:01:39.740
and take attendance from the participants listed.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.123
When class is over, click the red button,

00:01:42.123 --> 00:01:45.291
and choose “End the call for everyone”.

00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:48.345
Then post any homework in “Classwork”.

00:01:48.345 --> 00:01:49.464
You’re all set.

00:01:49.464 --> 00:01:53.463
The written steps are on the Online Classes page of the school website.

00:01:53.463 --> 00:01:59.951
If a class or setting is missing, email issvsupport@learnislam.org.
